Package: amarplayer
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muammar <xmuammar@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 84
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-gi, python3-gst-1.0, python3-mutagen, python3-pil, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/xmuammar/amarPlayer
Description: Modern music player for Linux
 amarPlayer is a desktop music player built with Python, PySide6
 and GStreamer.
 .
 Features include playlist management, metadata, album artwork,
 search, shuffle, repeat and a 10-band equalizer.
